# Ether Themes — Core

## Navigation (default)

**Graphify first.** Before grepping or reading source for architecture questions, query `.graphify/graph.json` via MCP or `npx graphify query`. After agent edits to `src/`, `shared/`, `apps/website/src/`, or `tests/`, the Cursor hook rebuilds the graph on stop; run `npm run graphify:rebuild` if the session aborted. See `graphify.mdc`.

Token-driven **VS Code / Cursor extension**: **50 dark palettes** → generated color themes, **496 snippets** → generated `.code-snippets`. No runtime extension code — everything is build-time generation.

Palette authoring uses an **anchor-first** workflow (`surfacePanel` + `surfaceEditor` first, then surfaces → foreground → accent → syntax). See `ether-themes.mdc` for conventions.

## Architecture

```
src/palettes/*.js          → src/generator/ + src/workbench/ + src/syntax/
                           → themes/*.color-theme.json

src/snippets/catalog/*.js  → src/snippets/generator.js + validate.js
                           → snippets/*.code-snippets

shared/*.js                → apps/website/scripts/prepare-data.mjs
                           → apps/website/src/generated/site-data.ts

src/build.js               → runs pipelines, syncs package.json contributes
```

## Source of truth vs generated

| Edit these | Never hand-edit |
|------------|-----------------|
| `src/palettes/`, `src/workbench/`, `src/syntax/`, `src/utils/` | `themes/*.color-theme.json` |
| `src/snippets/catalog/` (non-synced modules) | `snippets/*.code-snippets` |
| `src/generator/`, `src/snippets/generator.js`, tests | `package.json` → `contributes` |
| `apps/website/src/` | `site/`, `apps/website/src/generated/` |

After source changes: `npm run build:extension` (fast) or `npm run build` (full). Use `npm run check:fast` before claiming work complete; `npm run check` for palette/preview changes.

## Code style

- **ESM only** (`import`/`export`), Node 20+, plain JavaScript with JSDoc types in extension source.
- **Website**: TypeScript + React in `apps/website/`.
- Palette ids: `ether-{name}` kebab-case; snippet keys kebab-case.
- **Minimal diffs** — reuse `src/utils/color.js` and existing patterns.
- **Tests**: Vitest in `tests/` — add coverage for new validation rules.

## Agent constraints

- Do not commit, push, publish, or bump version unless explicitly asked.
- Do not skip CI hooks or force-push.
- README/CHANGELOG updates only when the user requests docs changes.
- Preview themes via **F5** (Extension Development Host), not by editing generated JSON.
- See `AGENTS.md` and `CONTRIBUTING.md` for full workflow.
